"P417409157" "Damn, it looks like Chimera was able to get a signal off before you defeated him. All the scanners in Praetoria just died. We need to send you back to that forest and see what happened. It might be a jammer, or it might be that they destroyed them all.<br><br>If Emperor Cole is planning something big, we can't be blindsided.<A HREF={ACCEPT}> If the scanners are being jammed, find the source and unjam it. If they are destroyed or disabled, finish the job so they don't get their hands on any tech they might have left behind.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P454177730" "Check on the scanners"
// SendOffString :
"P3149221288" "I'd say those scanners are more trouble than they were worth, but they've kept us aprised of the situation in Praetoria for weeks."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3229709359" "Check on the Dimensional Scanners"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2834991342" "We still don't know what's going on why all those data scanners went dead. {HeroName}, go find out!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

