"P984136641" "Looks like I spoke too soon. Even though you destroyed all the scanners on Praetoria, Neuron got his hands on Vanguard's communication software. That's got a collapsing algorithm that he can use to piggy-back on our communications channels like we were doing to theirs, and that's not good. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>We need to get to Neuron's mainframe and remove all traces of that software.</A> Vanguard is willing to offer up one of their best, Serpent Drummer, to assist in this mission. I am getting the coordinates to Neuron's lab now."
// AcceptString :
"P4217472353" "Destroy all evidence of Vanguard's software"
// SendOffString :
"P3234176653" "In Neuron's hands, that software is extremely dangerous. Purge every copy you can find."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2753106874" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four</color>"

