// IntroString :
"P789441468" "I really wonder what Emperor Cole has up his sleeves. I mean, I want to think we stopped whatever plan he had cooked up, but I have a bad feeling that we may have just accelerated his time table.<br><br>Positron has been doing some of his own investigation and believes that there is a clue to Cole's plan somewhere on Warrior Earth, the place where Battle Maiden and Valkyrie got their powers. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>He wants you to go there and investigate some leads.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1631832990" "Investigate Warrior Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P688642725" "Battle Maiden may be there, so you might want to bring other allies along with you."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P397691594" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5.1_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3869783316" "Have you learned anything from Warrior Earth yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2285846783" "The sound of steel on steel quickens your heartbeat."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3853818593" "Battle Maiden asked us to place these devices in very specific places."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4275504403" "I wonder what these are for?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - DimensionalResonator 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P678991792" "Find any clues"
