"P826846204" "You have been interrupted"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3129459873" "You have disassembled the machine."
// InteractActionString :
"P4231323226" "Disassembling..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2500939098" "You have recovered the machine"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2878928401" "You have recovered the Dimensional Resonator, you need to return this to Tina Macintyre."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5.1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P241403843" "Take Resonator to Tina"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4216546350" "Go see Tina Macintyre about that Resonator."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3307126202" "Back again, {HeroName}? What have we here? A Dimensional Resonator, let me take a look. It seems to be a scrambler set to disrupt the types of scanners we were spying on Praetoria with. I wonder why they were setting this up on Warrior Earth though?<br><br>We've got coordinates to Battle Maiden's lair. Perhaps you can persuade her to talk, give a reason why her minions were on Warrior Earth setting these up."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Compound5.1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1682260675" "Defeat Battle Maiden to gather info"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3808668403" "Battle Maiden is our best shot at learning what Emperor Cole is up to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4150978472" "The caverns' air is ice cold; little thought is given to comfort in Battle Maiden's domain."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1876743934" "Battle Maiden"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2765410160" "With those Resonators in place, Emperor Cole will be pleased"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1253702453" "{HeroName}? Here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P4282176370" "Ah, finally, a true warrior joins the fight!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2691094652" "Emperor Cole will conquer your entire dimension!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P2049792353" "You will have no way to detect his army!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1479874313" "Your deaths will be swift!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P591127055" "No, it can not be!"
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P541494016" "<em victory>And so the victory begins early!"

