"P3510415388" "Battle Maiden may have revealed too much in that fight"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2697785701" "You have defeated Battle Maiden and learned a vital clue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3342870813" "Using other dimensions as staging grounds, eh? Doing that gives them even more of an edge against us. We're going to need to check out other dimensions that the Praetorians have access to."
// RandomFameString :
"P3152079609" "I hear {HeroName} took down Battle Maiden!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4116183070" "Tina Macintyre and I were looking up those other dimensions that the Praetorians frequent. Nightstar has that nighttime dimension, and Black Swan has that version of the Shadow Shard she created. Tina said she opened a portal to Shadow World and a whole slew of those living shadow minions of Black Swan's streamed out. They are all over Portal Corporation causing all sorts of destruction and panic. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get over there A.S.A.P. and stop those Shadows!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3122734097" "Rescue Portal Corp from the shadow invasion!"
// SendOffString :
"P3612697626" "Just check in with me to get over to Portal Corporation!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P861024744" "Save Portal Corporation"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3675717618" "Portal Corporation is in trouble!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1466364941" "<color deepskyblue>Part Six</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P791358888" "It's worse than you thought."
