"P2354581511" "Mistress will bring the shadows forth."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_GUARDING_DIALOG :
"P2999805369" "Protect the door to our world!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3038063654" "Mistress says to kill that one twice!"

