// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission8.1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P512628064" "Penelope Yin thinks that Mother Mayhem's insanity may be behind Positron's abduction. On Praetoria, Praetor Tilman, 'Mother', runs the Mother of Mercy Psychiatric Hospital. That is her public facing headquarters. Her nasty side shows up in her secret asylum. If they are going to try to pry secrets out of Positron's brain, they'd do it there.  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Penelope Yin will go with you to help you take down that asylum.</A> She'll meet you on the other side of the portal."
// AcceptString :
"P1890442233" "Search the asylum with Penelope Yin"
// SendOffString :
"P779502964" "If the Praetorians have done anything to Positron, they'll have to deal with the Freedom Phalanx."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2158853096" "Find Positron"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4272328741" "Have you found any sign of Positron yet? {HeroName}, if they draw out any secrets from his mind we have to know!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P26137137" "<color deepskyblue>Part Eight</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2805222914" "Praetor Tilman, aka Mother Mayhem, creates her creepy Seers here."
