// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3058656842" "Diabolique is Emperor Cole's personal ghost. She's bound to him and has no free will of her own, if she's involved then Emperor Cole is defintely pulling the strings. The Praetorian Infernal acts as her bodyguard on occassion, if they have Positron, it's going to be a tough fight. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get to Infernal's Lair and see if they have him. </A><br><br>Infernal keeps his lair in the tunnels system under Praetoria. You'll likely encounter Resistance as well, and they tend to shoot first and ask questions later."
// AcceptString :
"P4039630662" "Search Infernal's lair for any sign of Positron"
// SendOffString :
"P1314558434" "Positron is one of the greatest heroes I have ever met, and I've made the acquaintance of quite a few.<br><br>I'll call around and try to get you some backup."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2518142321" "Positron may be in Infernal's torture chamber right this minute."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1501740073" "<color deepskyblue>Part Nine</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1828626512" "You can't tell in this light, but it's possible that the walls are stained with blood."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P234194146" "My heebie-jeebies have totally hit eleven... Why are we here again, slammer?"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3946193612" "Don't be a squeakbeast, chomper!  Remember... Be the lion, not the squeakbeast!"
