"P3475156389" "That ghost was creepy."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2464186298" "Infernal may have given us just the info we need. When we get back to Primal Earth, I will talk to Vanguard and figure out what is going on."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3352535467" "Diabolique"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2024438846" "Yes, my Master."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
