// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FakeStatesmanTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P628284525" "Is everything prepared?"
// Answer Text :
"P1722548035" "Positron, let's go."
// Answer Text :
"P1754663863" "Something is wrong here."
// Page GoTime Text :
"P3318808562" "Yes, Lady Grey, I need to speak to you."
// Answer Text :
"P2688280193" "I'm {HeroName}, not Lady Grey. You can speak to her when we get back to Primal Earth."
// Page LadyGrey Text :
"P3162881795" "Transmit War Wall Code: Authorization Cole-Whiskey-Niner-Two-Tango"
// Answer Text :
"P3365783710" "What are you doing? Are you trying to lower the War Walls?!"
// Page LowerWalls Text :
"P3626301149" "Do not question my order, Lady Grey. Transmit War Wall Code: Authorization Cole-Whiskey-Niner-Two-Tango."
// Answer Text :
"P2973124159" "Oh no. This... isn't Positron!"
// Page Suspicious Text :
"P3220574585" "Are you questioning me, Lady Grey? Transmit War Wall Code: Authorization Cole-Whiskey-Niner-Two-Tango."
// Page NotTheStatesman Text :
"P1961363668" "%#page error# Unit Designate: Positron under suspicion. &&"
// Answer Text :
"P4183289189" "This is some... hyper-advanced Clockwork. Looks exactly like his power armor."
// Answer Text :
"P2009875805" "Looks like they didn't get to finish programming him."

